    "detail": {
      "id": 1000977,
      "name": "[Affinity] \"Such Might\"",
      "desc": "Ju Fufu has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Super Scary Little Tiger]</color>.\n[Super Scary Little Tiger]: Upon entering combat, Ju Fufu's CRIT Rate increases by 12%, and she immediately gains 100 <color=#FFFFFF>Might</color>. When Ju Fufu's <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> hits an enemy, when the target is Stunned, the target's Stun DMG Multiplier increases by 35%, lasting for 30s.",
      "desc2": "According to your dear senior Fufu herself, tiger Thirens naturally possess a protective aura called Might during battle.\nAlthough it can't be explained by either science or sorcery, Fufu's fighting spirit is definitely all fired up.",
